    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d505-a15">

                <pb facs="0568" n="518" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg518"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Document No. 15.—From Lisbon to Buenos
                        Ayres.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-25"><hi rendition="#small-caps">March</hi> 25,
                        1894</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé d’affaires of
                    Portugal:</hi></p>
                <p>Please send following telegram to commander of <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Mindello</hi> as quickly as possible; as the arrival of the transport would
                    take a long time, it is well to try to put in at Loanda, or at least at St.
                    Helena, where Bartholomen Dias will probably arrive the same day. In no case
                    whatever disembark fugitives without having received orders.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Neves Ferreira.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
